OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a fine dry day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine across Shetland. A
OL,7,Flittle cloudier over Orkney but still
OL,8,Flong sunny spells. Light to moderate
OL,9,Fsoutheasterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening with patchy
OL,12,Fcloud and some long clear spells.
OL,13,FOvernight a few showers will start to
OL,14,Fdrift in from the North Sea on
OL,15,Ffreshening southeasterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FSunny intervals and showers
OL,18,Fon Tuesday. Thicker cloud will bring
OL,19,Fmore general rain to Orkney later.
OL,20,FFresh to strong southeasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
